- No kidding.


00:02:28.395 --> 00:02:31.956
Oh. L... Sorry.
I didn't think you'd be awake.


00:02:32.132 --> 00:02:33.292
You have an appointment...


00:02:33.467 --> 00:02:36.061
...with Guy Morgan,
I didn't think you'd wanna be late.


00:02:36.236 --> 00:02:39.171
Oh, look at you thinking. Cute.


00:02:39.339 --> 00:02:41.398
But I always have time for my portrait.


00:02:41.575 --> 00:02:43.099
Look alive. Paint.


00:02:43.543 --> 00:02:45.374
I'm feeling spiritually blocked.


00:02:45.545 --> 00:02:47.376
