Guy Morgan.


00:07:04.738 --> 00:07:06.569
Could you give his son, Luke, a tour?


00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:09.607
Sure. Would you like
to see the Wellesley perks?


00:07:09.776 --> 00:07:12.404
Um, yes, brilliant. Sure.


00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:14.870
- Katie.
I love your accent.


00:07:15.048 --> 00:07:16.640
Katie.
Wanna come over tonight?


00:07:16.816 --> 00:07:19.182
What are you still doing here? Go.


00:07:19.352 --> 00:07:22.753
