Out. Now.


00:07:23.356 --> 00:07:28.760
So, Guy, you've gotta tell me,
what was that like working under Mick?


00:07:37.637 --> 00:07:39.332
Watch out.


00:07:39.806 --> 00:07:41.831
- Dangerous balls.
- Ha, ha. Thanks.


00:07:42.842 --> 00:07:46.437
- So you womanned up and did it?
Hey!


00:07:46.613 --> 00:07:48.410
- Oh, I did it.
Hey!


00:07:48.581 --> 00:07:50.947
- What happened?
Can we have our ball?


00:07:51.117 --> 00:07:52.482
I didn't give my CD to Luke.


00:07:52.652 --> 00:07:55.644
I snuck it in his dad's bag.


00:07:55.822 --> 00:07:59.781
But Guy Morgan has your demo.
That's huge. What you need is a champion.


00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:01.689
No, what I need is to graduate.


00:08:02.529 --> 00:08:04.429
You giving our ball back or what?


00:08:04.597 --> 00:08:08.226
Oh, do you want this?


00:08:13.039 --> 00:08:16.304
She shoots, she scores.
Unlike you, soccer boy.


00:08:18.645 --> 00:08:22.376
Oh, so spill it. Is Luke Morgan
as hot as everyone Tweets he is?


00:08:22.549 --> 00:08:23.914
Hotter.


00:08:24.084 --> 00:08:25.711
You should ask him to the dance.


00:08:25.885 --> 00:08:28.115
Because I'm so forward with guys.


00:08:28.288 --> 00:08:30.848
First time for everything, right?


00:08:37.998 --> 00:08:39.693
- Hi, Luke.
- Hello.


00:08:39.866 --> 00:08:41.094
You have to hear my demo.


00:08:41.568 --> 00:08:44.628
It's a retro-funk-jazz explosion.


00:08:44.804 --> 00:08:46.999
Back off. I was here first.


00:08:47.173 --> 00:08:50.631
Hold on, hold up. Please hold on.
My boy does not want your demos yet.


00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:53.074
Walk away. Move along. Bye.


00:08:53.246 --> 00:08:56.613
It was nice chatting
or whatever that was.


00:08:56.883 --> 00:08:59.215
- Yes, hi, I'm, uh...
- Luke Morgan, right?


00:08:59.386 --> 00:09:00.910
Who is producing the Showcase.


00:09:01.087 --> 00:09:03.988
I don't think I'm gonna do the Showcase,
so I need to keep a low profile...


00:09:04.157 --> 00:09:07.593
Yeah, yeah. Listen close now.
There's two kinds of people in this school.


00:09:07.761 --> 00:09:11.288
There are the wannabes
and there's gonnabes.


00:09:11.464 --> 00:09:16.629
You and I, we're gonnabes. What do we do?
We stay away from the wannabes, all right?


00:09:16.803 --> 00:09:20.364
And girls named Yolanda. There are three
of them and they are certifiably...


00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.633
Crazy? You attract
crazy women? Shocking.


00:09:22.809 --> 00:09:25.710
It may seem like I don't have game,
but ladies love a listener.


00:09:25.879 --> 00:09:28.006
Plus, I'm telling you,
let me help you find acts.


00:09:28.181 --> 00:09:31.207
- Ah, so you're a talent scout?
- Well, bottom line, I'm a DJ.


00:09:31.384 --> 00:09:33.579
- Oh, you're a DJ as well?
- Check this.


00:09:42.128 --> 00:09:43.390
Whoa.


00:09:43.563 --> 00:09:46.657
Okay, yes. You could be very useful.
It was nice meeting you.


00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:49.495
You got a girl for the dance?
Because I can hook you up.


00:09:49.669 --> 00:09:50.829
Uh, no. Thanks.


00:09:51.004 --> 00:09:54.405
Uh, but what do you know
about Bev Van Ravensway?


00:09:54.574 --> 00:09:56.235
- Supposed to see her tonight.
- Bev?


00:09:56.409 --> 00:09:57.433
- Yeah.
- She's hot...


00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:00.078
...but the girl
is mad, mad drama, okay?


00:10:00.246 --> 00:10:02.646
I am talking to you
and you don't even know my name.


00:10:02.816 --> 00:10:04.716
- I'm Mickey O'Malley.
- Mickey O'Malley.


00:10:04.884 --> 00:10:06.511
A rarity in the Irish community.


00:10:07.087 --> 00:10:09.180
Om.


00:10:09.989 --> 00:10:12.617
RAVl: Om.
- Om.


00:10:12.792 --> 00:10:14.885
- Om.
- Om!


00:10:15.061 --> 00:10:17.586
This is not a contest, Ms. Gail.


00:10:17.964 --> 00:10:19.591
Just concentrate on your breathing.


00:10:21.101 --> 00:10:22.261
My butt is numb.


00:10:22.602 --> 00:10:25.799
If your butt is suffering,
then you are suffering.


00:10:25.972 --> 00:10:29.430
In fact, your entire life is suffering. Why?


00:10:29.609 --> 00:10:32.703
Because you crave
that which is meaningless.


00:10:32.879 --> 00:10:34.870
Are you calling me shallow?


00:10:35.949 --> 00:10:41.785
No, I'm saying to stop your craving
and release your butt.


00:10:41.955 --> 00:10:45.516
Just release it. Release it, yeah.
Release that butt.


00:10:46.392 --> 00:10:49.452
<i>Release that butt
Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:49.629 --> 00:10:52.223
<i>Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:52.398 --> 00:10:53.695
Mrs. Van Ravensway?


00:10:53.867 --> 00:10:56.392
What part
of "if you interrupt my meditation...


00:10:56.569 --> 00:10:59.766
...I will jerk your tail in a knot"
do you not understand?


00:10:59.939 --> 00:11:02.373
You told me
to tell you when dinner was ready.


00:11:02.542 --> 00:11:05.943
Oh, thank God.
I'm craving some bourbon.


00:11:09.716 --> 00:11:11.183
Victor.


00:11:11.351 --> 00:11:16.584
- Oh. Um, dinner's ready.
- Tell me something I don't know.


00:11:40.246 --> 00:11:44.683
Do you have any idea how stressful it is
to run this academy?


00:11:45.018 --> 00:11:47.509
Yes, I spent the money at the spa.


00:11:48.555 --> 00:11:51.217
<i>Five thousand dollars a night
is not very expensive...</i>


00:11:51.391 --> 00:11:55.953
<i>... when you think about the alternative,
which is me having a nervous breakdown.</i>


00:11:59.265 --> 00:12:00.289
<i>Ow.</i>


00:12:00.466 --> 00:12:02.900
<i>What are you doing?
I'm on the phone.</i>


00:12:03.069 --> 00:12:04.661
<i>- I'm cleansing.
Heh, heh.</i>


00:12:04.871 --> 00:12:07.101
Mac and cheese.


00:12:08.007 --> 00:12:11.135
<i>I don't need your spiritual counseling.</i>


00:12:11.678 --> 00:12:13.236
<i>I'm thinking of firing you.</i>


00:12:18.751 --> 00:12:22.118
Pace yourself, Ms. Gail,
or you will not be one with everything.


00:12:22.288 --> 00:12:25.621
Honey, that's what I got you for.
Now, make me one with everything.


00:12:27.026 --> 00:12:30.223
This Showcase is giving me the vapors.


00:12:30.396 --> 00:12:32.489
How did this become my life?


00:12:32.665 --> 00:12:35.657
Did I ever tell you all about the time
I nearly got my big break?


00:12:35.835 --> 00:12:37.325
Yes.
- Good.


00:12:37.503 --> 00:12:38.936
Then you all know how it goes.


00:12:39.372 --> 00:12:41.567
<i>I ain't gonna leap, I'm gonna jump</i>


00:12:41.741 --> 00:12:44.073
<i>Find my way right out of this dump</i>


00:12:46.913 --> 00:12:49.780
- I had talent, and they made me...
A laughingstock.


00:12:51.551 --> 00:12:52.848
Now look at me.


00:12:53.019 --> 00:12:55.510
I got two ungrateful kids...


00:12:55.688 --> 00:12:58.680
...a dwarfish, hairy, elfin servant...


00:12:58.858 --> 00:13:00.849
