01:04:52.520 --> 01:04:55.387
<i>You know, hello, longer legs.</i>


01:04:55.556 --> 01:04:59.219
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Before you go...
- I'll sing for Bev. Don't worry.


01:04:59.693 --> 01:05:01.718
Well, that was easier than I thought.


01:05:01.896 --> 01:05:03.761
Now, go and make me a vodka tonic.


01:05:03.931 --> 01:05:05.489
Hold the tonic.


01:05:15.209 --> 01:05:17.200
Her reign of terror's gotta stop.


01:05:17.378 --> 01:05:18.902
I'm in. What do we do?


01:05:19.080 --> 01:05:20.911
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:21.582 --> 01:05:23.948
If you try to help,
it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:24.118 --> 01:05:27.144
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:27.321 --> 01:05:28.652
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:28.823 --> 01:05:30.654
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:30.825 --> 01:05:34.226
