I hate you.


01:05:39.667 --> 01:05:41.931
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:42.103 --> 01:05:43.798
I know.


01:05:45.473 --> 01:05:48.306
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:48.476 --> 01:05:50.137
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:50.311 --> 01:05:53.144
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:53.314 --> 01:05:54.406
Are you an idiot?


01:05:54.582 --> 01:05:56.743
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:56.917 --> 01:05:58.782
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:58.953 --> 01:06:01.353
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:06:01.522 --> 01:06:03.717
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:03.891 --> 01:06:05.290
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:07.728 --> 01:06:09.355
I sort of love you too.


01:06:09.964 --> 01:06:14.424
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:14.902 --> 01:06:16.494
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:16.670 --> 01:06:18.604
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:18.772 --> 01:06:20.262
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:21.175 --> 01:06:22.506
Okay.


01:06:22.776 --> 01:06:27.179
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:42.696 --> 01:06:46.325
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:46.600 --> 01:06:48.761
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:48.936 --> 01:06:51.029
Oh, okay.


01:06:51.205 --> 01:06:53.730
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:54.642 --> 01:06:58.544
