01:08:02.910 --> 01:08:04.639
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:08:04.812 --> 01:08:06.746
Just look at Mom.


01:08:08.916 --> 01:08:10.042
You think I'm talented?


01:08:11.852 --> 01:08:13.945
