01:08:15.656 --> 01:08:17.180
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:17.358 --> 01:08:19.326
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:22.429 --> 01:08:23.657
This better work.


01:08:24.231 --> 01:08:26.461
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:39.446 --> 01:08:43.109
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:43.284 --> 01:08:46.378
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:46.553 --> 01:08:50.546
