01:11:58.812 --> 01:12:01.280
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:12:01.448 --> 01:12:05.350
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:08.155 --> 01:12:09.520
Move it. Guy.


01:12:09.690 --> 01:12:13.888
