01:17:16.296 --> 01:17:18.161
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:18.331 --> 01:17:20.128
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:20.300 --> 01:17:25.670
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:28.441 --> 01:17:30.409
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:38.118 --> 01:17:42.111
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:45.225 --> 01:17:49.855
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:51.097 --> 01:17:54.658
