01:21:23.476 --> 01:21:24.943
Guy!


01:21:26.279 --> 01:21:29.942
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:30.183 --> 01:21:33.949
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:35.422 --> 01:21:38.482
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:38.658 --> 01:21:41.252
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:41.428 --> 01:21:42.986
Let's try this again.


01:21:43.196 --> 01:21:45.061
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:46.633 --> 01:21:49.363
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:15.028 --> 01:22:17.258
Hey. Clear.


01:22:32.946 --> 01:22:35.107
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:35.281 --> 01:22:37.647
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:19.526 --> 01:23:22.120
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:22.295 --> 01:23:25.162
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:30.136 --> 01:23:33.663
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:40.113 --> 01:23:42.172
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:47.353 --> 01:23:51.653
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:56.095 --> 01:23:59.087
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:59.265 --> 01:24:01.392
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:20.887 --> 01:24:22.752
I love my life.


01:24:22.922 --> 01:24:25.117
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:47.580 --> 01:24:50.777
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

